Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, mediainfo, file, unzip, tar, unrar, p7zip
Description: blob-centric media and archive file scanner
 DosierSkanilo scans files, calculates checksums, extracts metadata and stores
 JSON results for duplicate detection.
